## Designing the piece

Select the areas that should glow instead of treating the effect as a general fill. The daytime artwork still needs enough contrast to stand on its own, while the luminous regions create a second reading in low light.

## Start with the artwork and intended use

Send the logo, sketch, or reference image together with the intended use, quantity, delivery country, and target date. These details give the team a practical basis for artwork review and a focused quotation; any undecided choices can remain open for discussion.
